### variable expands when the trap is set
trap "echo Interrupted after $num" INT
>>> SC2064 1:30
>>> SC2154 1:30

### backtick substitution runs when the trap is set
trap "echo Files: `ls`" INT
>>> SC2006 1:19
>>> SC2064 1:19

### arithmetic expands when the trap is set
trap "echo $((1 + num))" EXIT DEBUG
>>> SC2064 1:12
>>> SC2154 1:19

### several expansions each get reported
trap "rm -f $tmpfile ${lockfile}" EXIT
>>> SC2064 1:13
>>> SC2064 1:22
>>> SC2154 1:13
>>> SC2154 1:22

### single-quoted handler expands later
trap 'echo Interrupted after $num' INT
>>> SC2154 1:6

### mixed quoting is not examined
trap "rm -f "$tmpfile EXIT
>>> SC2086 1:14
>>> SC2154 1:14

### unquoted handler is not examined
trap $cleanup_cmd EXIT
>>> SC2086 1:6
>>> SC2154 1:6
